  "2026-11-28T04:24:03.109Z",codex-agent,"The base test fails on issue #57 because it treats a shared reference tag as an ownership claim. Reuse the released pm-github ownership index in the test, add explicit-owner collision coverage, and preserve the shared delivery assertions."
  "2026-11-28T04:25:18.439Z",codex-agent,"Revert proof, tracked corpus: restoring only the old tag-counting loop in a disposable copy of the base tracker fails with Duplicate importer identity unbraind/pm-review#57: pm-review-sync-identity and pm-review-github-d686d81c4a08-57."
  "2026-11-28T04:25:19.615Z",codex-agent,"Revert proof, true duplicates: the same mutation makes both the explicit URL versus repository-and-number fixture and the proven legacy importer ID fixture fail with Missing expected exception. The unmodified identity test passes all 3 cases."
  "2026-11-28T04:25:20.659Z",codex-agent,Pinned pm recorded and verified one native related edge from pm-review-sync-identity to pm-review-github-d686d81c4a08-57.
  "2026-11-28T04:26:03.855Z",codex-agent,Focused identity gate passed 3/3 directly and through the linked test. Typecheck and lint passed. Clean-home strict tracker health passed. The development dependency pins the published ownership index so the test uses the importer policy directly.
